    <briefdescription>
<para>Thread-safe incident emitter for all three training incident classes. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Centralises structured diagnostic emission across labeling/enrichment (dataset), training execution (training), and adapter lifecycle (adapter) code paths. Any number of <ref refid="classthemis_1_1training_1_1_training_incident_listener" kindref="compound">TrainingIncidentListener</ref> instances may be registered; all are notified synchronously on each <computeroutput>emit*</computeroutput> call.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Registration</title><para>Listeners are stored as <computeroutput>shared_ptr</computeroutput>. The emitter does not extend their lifetime beyond its own destruction, but the <computeroutput>shared_ptr</computeroutput> prevents premature deletion while the emitter holds a reference.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="par"><title>Performance</title><para><computeroutput>emit*</computeroutput> calls acquire a <computeroutput>std::mutex</computeroutput>; keep listeners lightweight or forward events asynchronously to avoid stalling training hot paths. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
